by nicolas-grekas at 2026-10-29T15:31:41Z

PR updated. I made Flex ignore uninstalls done with `--no-dev`, like it already does for recipes. Otherwise, `composer update --no-dev` would remove the entries of UX packages listed in require-dev. A failing `importmap:remove` now displays a warning instead of stopping Composer before symfony.lock is written.
